<title>USA: US corn gluten values steady-down, trade moderate.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten values steady-down, trade moderate.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten product prices were steady to lower Thursday, but trade activity was said to be brisk to moderate. &quot;I've booked a bunch of orders this morning already,&quot; a cash dealer said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
